  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 18 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nWith our vendors set on returning home, their motivation couldn't be clearer—this beloved single-level brick classic simply must be sold!\r\n\r\nOffering low-maintenance peace of mind, total privacy, and effortless charm, this single-storey gem delivers the ultimate sanctuary for relaxed family living.\r\n\r\nVendor Heading Home: Clear instructions to sell—this opportunity cannot be missed!\r\nClassic Single-Level Brick: Timeless, low-maintenance construction on a freehold section with scope to add value.\r\nPrivate Reserve Sanctuary: Step onto your sun-soaked rear deck overlooking lush reserve views and native birdsong.\r\nSun-Flooded Living: Open-plan spaces with floor-to-ceiling glass flowing to a fully fenced, kid and pet-safe yard.\r\nTop Education: Easy walk to Glamorgan School; zoned for Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College.\r\n\r\nThe vendors have made their choice to head home—now it's your turn to act. Present all offers!",
